  "Description": {
    "Cost": 1110527,
    "UIName": "Hammerhead",
    "Id": "chassisdef_hammerhead_HMD-Z",
    "Name": "Hammerhead",
    "Details": "This Society variant of the Hammerhead replaces the standard Large Pulse Laser with three ER Medium Lasers, mounted in both arms and the right torso, and adds a Nova CEWS that ties it into a network with nearby allies. It keeps the Streak SRM-6 and the center torso ER Medium Laser, as well as the hardened armor and leg Actuator Enhancement System that make the Hammerhead nearly impossible to topple, so it can still bash through enemy formations as a shock trooper. A Society Cockpit Interface completes the refit.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Battle Fists</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.11</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_hammerhead"
  },
  "VariantName": "HMD-Z",
  "ChassisTags": {
    "items": [
      "SocietyMech",
      "mr-resize-0.77"
    ]
  },
  "StockRole": "Skirmisher",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Hammerhead is a medium-sized Clan BattleMech designed as a skirmisher by Clan Sea Fox. Designed to loosely resemble a hammerhead shark, the design is intended to be aggressive with its opponents, yet also built around the concept of never getting knocked off its feet. Despite its merely adequate weapons array, the Hammerhead has achieved great success as a shock trooper wading though enemy formations to brawl with opponents twice its size at close range. This Society variant downgrades the lasers in order to install a Nova CEWS.",
